 artificielle","de":"Das ai-sdk ist ein Entwicklungskit, das die Umwandlung von Formularen in Konversationen mit künstlicher Intelligenz ermöglicht","pt":"O ai-sdk é uma ferramenta de IA que permite transformar formulários em conversas inteligentes.","ru":"ИИ Агенты: ai-sdk - это инструмент ИИ, который позволяет преобразовать формы в разговоры с ИИ.","ar":"ai-sdk هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تسمح بتحويل النماذج إلى محادثات ذكية."},"features":{"en":["Installs via pnpm add ai command","Utilizes node_modules/ai/docs/ for documentation","Supports provider packages like @ai-sdk/openai","Requires separate installation of client packages like @ai-sdk/react","Warns against trusting internal knowledge for outdated information","Specifies critical prerequisites before searching documentation"],"zh":["使用node_modules/ai/docs/安装和配置","支持provider packages（例如@ai-sdk/openai）","支持client packages（例如@ai-sdk/react）","将表单转换为对话","提高用户体验"],"ja":["node_modules/ai/docs/を使用してインストールと設定を行う","Providerパッケージ（例：@ai-sdk/openai）をサポート","クライアントパッケージ（例：@ai-sdk/react）をサポート","フォームを会話に変換","ユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる"],"ko":["node_modules/ai/docs/를 사용하여 설치하고 설정","프로バイ더 패키지（예：@ai-sdk/openai）를 지원","클라이언트 패키지（예：@ai-sdk/react）를 지원","양식을 대화로 전환","사용자 경험을 향상"],"es":["Instalación con Node.js y paquetes específicos","Compatibilidad con @ai-sdk/openai y @ai-sdk/react","Conversión de formularios en conversaciones con inteligencia artificial","Requiere la carpeta node_modules/ai/docs/ para la documentación","Soporte para la instalación de paquetes proveedores y clientes según sea necesario"],"fr":["Installation avec Node.js et packages spécifiques","Compatibilité avec @ai-sdk/openai et @ai-sdk/react","Transformation de formulaires en conversations avec l''intelligence artificielle","Nécessite le dossier node_modules/ai/docs/ pour la documentation","Support pour l''installation de packages fournisseurs et clients selon les besoins"],"de":["Installation mit Node.js und spezifischen Paketen","Kompatibilität mit @ai-sdk/openai und @ai-sdk/react","Umwandlung von Formularen in Konversationen mit künstlicher Intelligenz","Benötigt das Verzeichnis node_modules/ai/docs/ für die Dokumentation","Unterstützung für die Installation von Anbieter- und Client-Paketen nach Bedarf"],"pt":["Instalação do pacote ai via package manager (pnpm)","Integração com provedores de IA (e.g., @ai-sdk/openai)","Uso de pacotes de cliente (e.g., @ai-sdk/react) para interfaces de usuário","Transformação de formulários em conversas com IA","Suporte a múltiplos provedores de IA"],"ru":["Установка пакета ai через менеджер пакетов (pnpm)","Интеграция с провайдерами ИИ (например, @ai-sdk/openai)","Использование пакетов клиентов (например, @ai-sdk/react) для интерфейсов пользователя","Преобразование форм в разговоры с ИИ","Поддержка нескольких провайдеров ИИ"],"ar":["تثبيت حزمة ai عبر مدير الحزم (pnpm)","التكامل مع مزودي الذكاء الاصطناعي (على سبيل المثال @ai-sdk/openai)","استخدام حزم العميل (على سبيل المثال @ai-sdk/react) ل_interfaces المستخدم","تحويل النماذج إلى محادثات مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم مزودي الذكاء الاصطناعي المتعددين"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use ai-sdk","ai-sdk setup guide","ai-sdk vs conversational ai","ai-sdk install with pnpm","what is ai-sdk","ai-sdk alternative solutions","ai-sdk documentation","ai-sdk provider packages","ai-sdk client packages"],"zh":["AI SDK","表单转换","对话式界面","node_modules/ai/docs/","AIエージェント","软件开发工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント SDK","フォーム変換","会話式インターフェース","node_modules/ai/docs/","AIツール","ソフトウェア開発ツール"],"ko":["AI SDK","양식 전환","대화식 인터페이스","node_modules/ai/docs/","AI 에이전트","소프트웨어 개발 도구"],"es":["ai-sdk","inteligencia artificial","formularios conversacionales","node.js","paquetes npm","instalación de ai-sdk","configuración de ai-sdk","desarrollo de aplicaciones con ai-sdk"],"fr":["ai-sdk","intelligence artificielle","formulaires conversationnels","node.js","packages npm","installation d''ai-sdk","configuration d''ai-sdk","développement d''applications avec ai-sdk"],"de":["ai-sdk","künstliche Intelligenz","konversationale Formulare","node.js","npm-Pakete","Installation von ai-sdk","Konfiguration von ai-sdk","Anwendungsentwicklung mit ai-sdk"],"pt":["ai-sdk","ferramenta de IA","conversas inteligentes","formulários","pnpm","instalação de pacotes","provedores de IA","pacotes de cliente","react"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","ai-sdk","инструмент ИИ","разговоры с ИИ","формы","pnpm","установка пакетов","провайдеры ИИ","пакеты клиентов","react"],"ar":["أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي","ai-sdk","محادثات ذكية","نماذج","pnpm","تثبيت الحزم","مزودي الذكاء الاصطناعي","حزم العميل","react"]}},"owner":"growupanand","repo":"ConvoForm","repoPath":"growupanand/ConvoForm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.370Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-sdk","description":"Answer questions about the AI SDK and help build AI-powered features. Use when developers: (1) Ask about AI SDK functions like generateText, streamText, ToolLoopAgent, embed, or tools, (2) Want to build AI agents, chatbots, RAG systems, or text generation features, (3) Have questions about AI providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, etc.), streaming, tool calling, structured output, or embeddings, (4) Use React hooks like useChat or useCompletion. Triggers on: AI SDK, Vercel AI SDK, generateText, streamText, add AI to my app, build an agent, tool calling, structured output, useChat.","bodyPreview":"## Prerequisites\n\nBefore searching docs, check if `node_modules/ai/docs/` exists. If not, install **only** the `ai` package using the project''s package manager (e.g., `pnpm add ai`).\n\nDo not install other packages at this stage. Provider packages (e.g., `@ai-sdk/openai`) and client packages (e.g., `@ai-sdk/react`) should be installed later when needed based on user requirements.\n\n## Critical: Do Not Trust Internal Knowledge\n\nEverything you know about the AI SDK is outdated or wrong. Your trainin","body":"## Prerequisites\n\nBefore searching docs, check if `node_modules/ai/docs/` exists. If not, install **only** the `ai` package using the project''s package manager (e.g., `pnpm add ai`).\n\nDo not install other packages at this stage. Provider packages (e.g., `@ai-sdk/openai`) and client packages (e.g., `@ai-sdk/react`) should be installed later when needed based on user requirements.\n\n## Critical: Do Not Trust Internal Knowledge\n\nEverything you know about the AI SDK is outdated or wrong. Your training data contains obsolete APIs, deprecated patterns, and incorrect usage.\n\n**When working with the AI SDK:**\n\n1. Ensure `ai` package is installed (see Prerequisites)\n2. Search `node_modules/ai/docs/` and `node_modules/ai/src/` for current APIs\n3. If not found locally, search ai-sdk.dev documentation (instructions below)\n4. Never rely on memory - always verify against source code or docs\n5. **`useChat` has changed significantly** - check [Common Errors](references/common-errors.md) before writing client code\n6. When deciding which model and provider to use (e.g. OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini), use the Vercel AI Gateway provider unless the user specifies otherwise. See [AI Gateway Reference](references/ai-gateway.md) for usage details.\n7. **Always fetch current model IDs** - Never use model IDs from memory. Before writing code that uses a model, run `curl -s https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v1/models | jq -r ''[.data[] | select(.id | startswith(\"provider/\")) | .id] | reverse | .[]''` (replacing `provider` with the relevant provider like `anthropic`, `openai`, or `google`) to get the full list with newest models first. Use the model with the highest version number (e.g., `claude-sonnet-4-5` over `claude-sonnet-4` over `claude-3-5-sonnet`).\n8. Run typecheck after changes to ensure code is correct\n9. **Be minimal** - Only specify options that differ from defaults. When unsure of defaults, check docs or source rather than guessing or over-specifying.\n\nIf you cannot find documentation to support your answer, state that explicitly.\n\n## Finding Documentation\n\n### ai@6.0.34+\n\nSearch bundled docs and source in `node_modules/ai/`:\n\n- **Docs**: `grep \"query\" node_modules/ai/docs/`\n- **Source**: `grep \"query\" node_modules/ai/src/`\n\nProvider packages include docs at `node_modules/@ai-sdk/<provider>/docs/`.\n\n### Earlier versions\n\n1. Search: `https://ai-sdk.dev/api/search-docs?q=your_query`\n2. Fetch `.md` URLs from results (e.g., `https://ai-sdk.dev/docs/agents/building-agents.md`)\n\n## When Typecheck Fails\n\n**Before searching source code**, grep [Common Errors](references/common-errors.md) for the failing property or function name. Many type errors are caused by deprecated APIs documented there.\n\nIf not found in common-errors.md:\n\n1. Search `node_modules/ai/src/` and `node_modules/ai/docs/`\n2. Search ai-sdk.dev (for earlier versions or if not found locally)\n\n## Building and Consuming Agents\n\n### Creating Agents\n\nAlways use the `ToolLoopAgent` pattern. Search `node_modules/ai/docs/` for current agent creation APIs.\n\n**File conventions**: See [type-safe-agents.md](references/type-safe-agents.md) for where to save agents and tools.\n\n**Type Safety**: When consuming agents with `useChat`, always use `InferAgentUIMessage<typeof agent>` for type-safe tool results. See [reference](references/type-safe-agents.md).\n\n### Consuming Agents (Framework-Specific)\n\nBefore implementing agent consumption:\n\n1. Check `package.json` to detect the project''s framework/stack\n2. Search documentation for the framework''s quickstart guide\n3. Follow the framework-specific patterns for streaming, API routes, and client integration\n\n## References\n\n- [Common Errors](references/common-errors.md) - Renamed parameters reference (parameters → inputSchema, etc.)\n- [AI Gateway](references/ai-gateway.md) - Gateway setup and usage\n- [Type-Safe Agents with useChat](references/type-safe-agents.md) - End-to-end type safety with InferAgentUIMessage\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:04:24.851Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversational AI Agents needing seamless integration with AI providers via packages like @ai-sdk/openai","zh":"适用于需要与AI提供商通过包如@ai-sdk/openai实现无缝集成的对话式AI代理","ja":"会話AIエージェントが@ai-sdk/openaiのようなパッケージを介してAIプロバイダーとシームレスに統合する必要がある場合に適しています","ko":"AI 제공업체와의 무결점 통합을 필요로 하는 대화형 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 예를 들어 @ai-sdk/openai와 같은 패키지를 통해 통합할 수 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial Conversacional que necesitan una integración sin problemas con proveedores de IA a través de paquetes como @ai-sdk/openai","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA conversationnelle nécessitant une intégration transparente avec les fournisseurs d''IA via des packages tels que @ai-sdk/openai","de":"Ideal für Conversational AI Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration mit KI-Anbietern über Pakete wie @ai-sdk/openai benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Conversacional que necessitam de integração perfeita com provedores de IA por meio de pacotes como @ai-sdk/openai","ru":"Идеально для агентов разговорного ИИ, которым требуется бесшовная интеграция с поставщиками ИИ через пакеты như @ai-sdk/openai","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين للمحادثة الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج متكامل مع مزودي الذكاء الاصطناعي عبر حزم مثل @ai-sdk/openai"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform forms into conversations with AI using the ai-sdk package, installable via pnpm add ai, and later extended with provider packages like @ai-sdk/openai, enabling flexible and dynamic interactions via protocols and libraries","zh":"赋予代理能力，利用ai-sdk包将表单转换为与AI的对话，可以通过pnpm add ai安装，并后续通过provider包如@ai-sdk/openai扩展，实现灵活和动态的交互","ja":"エージェントに、ai-sdkパッケージを使用してフォームを会話AIに変換する能力を与え、pnpm add aiでインストールし、@ai-sdk/openaiなどのプロバイダーパッケージで後から拡張し、プロトコルとライブラリを介して柔軟で動的な相互作用を可能にします","ko":"에이전트에게 ai-sdk 패키지를 사용하여 폼을 대화형 AI로 변환할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, pnpm add ai로 설치하고, 나중에 @ai-sdk/openai와 같은 제공자 패키지로 확장하여, 프로토콜 및 라이브러리 통해 유연하고 동적인 상호 작용을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar formularios en conversaciones con IA utilizando el paquete ai-sdk, instalable a través de pnpm add ai, y posteriormente ampliado con paquetes de proveedores como @ai-sdk/openai, lo que permite interacciones flexibles y dinámicas a través de protocolos y bibliotecas","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des formulaires en conversations avec l''IA en utilisant le package ai-sdk, installable via pnpm add ai, puis étendu avec des packages de fournisseurs tels que @ai-sdk/openai, permettant ainsi des interactions flexibles et dynamiques via des protocoles et des bibliothèques","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Formulare in Gespräche mit KI mithilfe des ai-sdk-Pakets zu transformieren, das über pnpm add ai installiert werden kann und später mit Anbieterpaketen wie @ai-sdk/openai erweitert werden kann, wodurch flexible und dynamische Interaktionen über Protokolle und Bibliotheken ermöglicht werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar formulários em conversas com IA usando o pacote ai-sdk, instalável via pnpm add ai, e posteriormente estendido com pacotes de provedores como @ai-sdk/openai, permitindo interações flexíveis e dinâmicas via protocolos e bibliotecas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать формы в разговоры с ИИ с помощью пакета ai-sdk, устанавливаемого через pnpm add ai, и позже расширяемого пакетами поставщиков, такими как @ai-sdk/openai, что позволяет обеспечивать гибкие и динамические взаимодействия через протоколы и библиотеки","ar":"يُمكِّن الوكلاء من تحويل النماذج إلى محادثات مع الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام حزمة ai-sdk، والتي يمكن تثبيتها عبر pnpm add ai، وتمديدها فيما بعد مع حزم مزودي الخدمة مثل @ai-sdk/openai، مما يسمح بالتفاعلات المرنة والديناميكية عبر البروتوكولات والمكتبات"},"useCases":{"en":["Transforming static forms into interactive AI conversations","Installing and managing AI provider packages like @ai-sdk/openai","Generating dynamic content based on user inputs and AI responses"],"zh":["将静态表单转换为交互式AI对话","安装和管理AI提供商包如@ai-sdk/openai","基于用户输入和AI响应生成动态内容"],"ja":["静的フォームをインタラクティブな会話AIに変換する","@ai-sdk/openaiのようなAIプロバイダーパッケージをインストールして管理する","ユーザー入力とAIの応答に基づいて動的コンテンツを生成する"],"ko":["정적인 폼을 대화형 AI로 변환하는 것","@ai-sdk/openai와 같은 AI 제공자 패키지를 설치 및 관리하는 것","사용자 입력 및 AI 응답을 기반으로 동적 콘텐츠를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Transformar formularios estáticos en conversaciones interactivas de IA","Instalar y administrar paquetes de proveedores de IA como @ai-sdk/openai","Generar contenido dinámico en función de las entradas del usuario y las respuestas de IA"],"fr":["Transformer des formulaires statiques en conversations interactives d''IA","Installer et gérer des packages de fournisseurs d''IA tels que @ai-sdk/openai","Générer du contenu dynamique en fonction des entrées de l''utilisateur et des réponses de l''IA"],"de":["Statische Formulare in interaktive KI-Gespräche umwandeln","Installation und Verwaltung von KI-Anbieterpaketen wie @ai-sdk/openai","Dynamischen Inhalt basierend auf Benutzereingaben und KI-Antworten generieren"],"pt":["Transformar formulários estáticos em conversas interativas de IA","Instalar e gerenciar pacotes de provedores de IA como @ai-sdk/openai","Gerar conteúdo dinâmico com base em entradas de usuário e respostas de IA"],"ru":["Преобразование статических форм в интерактивные разговоры ИИ","Установка и управление пакетами поставщиков ИИ, такими как @ai-sdk/openai","Генерация динамического контента на основе ввода пользователя и ответов ИИ"],"ar":["تحويل النماذج الثابتة إلى محادثات تفاعلية للذكاء الاصطناعي","تثبيت وإدارة حزم مزودي الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل @ai-sdk/openai","توليد محتوى ديناميكي بناءً على مدخلات المستخدم واستجابات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires installation of the ai package before adding provider packages","Dependent on the project''s package manager, such as pnpm"],"zh":["需要在添加提供商包之前安装ai包","依赖于项目的包管理器，如pnpm"],"ja":["プロバイダーパッケージを追加する前にaiパッケージをインストールする必要がある","プロジェクトのパッケージマネージャー（例：pnpm）に依存する"],"ko":["제공자 패키지를 추가하기 전에 ai 패키지를 설치해야 하는 것","프로젝트의 패키지 관리자(pnpm 등)에 의존하는 것"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del paquete ai antes de agregar paquetes de proveedores","Depende del administrador de paquetes del proyecto, como pnpm"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du package ai avant d''ajouter des packages de fournisseurs","Dépend du gestionnaire de packages du projet, tel que pnpm"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation des ai-Pakets, bevor Anbieterpakete hinzugefügt werden","Hängt vom Paket-Manager des Projekts ab, wie z.B. pnpm"],"pt":["Requer a instalação do pacote ai antes de adicionar pacotes de provedores","Depende do gerenciador de pacotes do projeto, como pnpm"],"ru":["Требует установки пакета ai до добавления пакетов поставщиков","Зависит от менеджера пакетов проекта, такого как pnpm"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت حزمة ai قبل إضافة حزم مزودي الخدمة","يعتمد على مدير حزم المشروع، مثل pnpm"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"af48f91f4fbfc387387a3e1cc203caf3375f45aa9558bd67aaa77dc92d24e57d","qualityScore":35}');
