Executa testes de unidade e integração com Maven","Suporta testes de frontend com Angular","Permite a execução de testes de e2e com Playwright","Oferece opções de configuração para personalizar os testes","Inclui suporte para testes de backend com Quarkus"],"ru":["Запускает модульные и интеграционные тесты с помощью Maven","Поддерживает тестирование frontend с Angular","Позволяет запускать тесты e2e с Playwright","Предоставляет варианты настройки для персонализации тестов","Включает поддержку тестирования backend с Quarkus"],"ar":["تشغل الاختبارات الوحدوية والتكاملية مع Maven","تدعم الاختبارات الأمامية مع Angular","تسمح بتشغيل الاختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية مع Playwright","توفر خيارات للتنضيم لتعديل الاختبارات","تتضمن دعم الاختبارات الخلفية مع Quarkus"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use run-tests","run-tests setup guide","automated testing with run-tests","run-tests vs Jest","run-tests install","what is run-tests","run-tests alternative","run-tests for Quarkus","run-tests for Angular"],"zh":["AIエージェント","Run Tests","Angular测试","Quarkus测试","端到端测试","mvn test","playwright test"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Run Tests","Angularテスト","Quarkusテスト","エンドツーエンドテスト","mvn test","playwright test"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Run Tests","Angular 테스트","Quarkus 테스트","엔드 투 엔드 테스트","mvn test","playwright test"],"es":["herramientas de AI para pruebas","ejecución de pruebas automatizadas","pruebas de unidad con Maven","pruebas de integración con Maven","pruebas de extremo a extremo con Playwright","desarrollo de software con AI","pruebas de software con KI","automatización de pruebas con AI"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les tests","exécution de tests automatisés","tests d''unité avec Maven","tests d''intégration avec Maven","tests de bout en bout avec Playwright","développement de logiciels avec IA","tests de logiciels avec IA","automatisation des tests avec IA"],"de":["KI-Tools für Tests","Ausführung von automatisierten Tests","Einheitstests mit Maven","IntegrationsTests mit Maven","End-to-End-Tests mit Playwright","Softwareentwicklung mit KI","Softwaretests mit KI","Automatisierung von Tests mit KI"],"pt":["run-tests","teste de unidade","teste de integração","Maven","Angular","Playwright","Quarkus","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de teste"],"ru":["run-tests","модульное тестирование","интеграционное тестирование","Maven","Angular","Playwright","Quarkus","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты тестирования"],"ar":["run-tests","اختبار الوحدات","اختبار التكامل","Maven","Angular","Playwright","Quarkus","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الاختبار"]}},"owner":"abstratium-dev","repo":"abstrauth","repoPath":"abstratium-dev/abstrauth","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.534Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"run-tests","description":"Runs unit and integration tests, Angular tests, and optionally also E2E tests.","bodyPreview":"# Run Tests\n\n## When to use this skill\nUse this skill when the user needs to run tests.\n\n## How to run tests\n1. Use `mvn test -DskipTests -DskipITs` to run just the Angular frontend tests.\n2. Use `mvn test` to run unit and integration tests of the Quarkus backend, as well as the Angular frontend tests.\n3. Use `ALLOW_SIGNUP=true PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN=never npx playwright test` in the `e2e-tests` directory to run the \"signup\" e2e tests.\n4. Use `ALLOW_SIGNUP=false PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN=never npx play","body":"# Run Tests\n\n## When to use this skill\nUse this skill when the user needs to run tests.\n\n## How to run tests\n1. Use `mvn test -DskipTests -DskipITs` to run just the Angular frontend tests.\n2. Use `mvn test` to run unit and integration tests of the Quarkus backend, as well as the Angular frontend tests.\n3. Use `ALLOW_SIGNUP=true PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN=never npx playwright test` in the `e2e-tests` directory to run the \"signup\" e2e tests.\n4. Use `ALLOW_SIGNUP=false PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN=never npx playwright test` in the `e2e-tests` directory to run the \"nosignup\" e2e tests.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:09.197Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing automated testing for Quarkus backend and Angular frontend applications with Maven and Playwright support.","zh":"非常适合需要为Quarkus后端和Angular前端应用程序自动化测试的全栈代理，并支持Maven和Playwright。","ja":"QuarkusバックエンドとAngularフロントエンドアプリケーションに対して自動テストが必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適です。MavenとPlaywrightをサポートしています。","ko":"Quarkus 백엔드와 Angular 프론트엔드 애플리케이션에 대한 자동화 테스트가 필요한 풀 스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Maven 및 Playwright를 지원합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Stack Completo que necesitan pruebas automatizadas para aplicaciones de backend Quarkus y frontend Angular con soporte de Maven y Playwright.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin de tests automatisés pour les applications backend Quarkus et frontend Angular avec prise en charge de Maven et Playwright.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die automatisierte Tests für Quarkus-Backend- und Angular-Frontend-Anwendungen mit Maven- und Playwright-Unterstützung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de testes automatizados para aplicações backend Quarkus e frontend Angular com suporte ao Maven e Playwright.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, которым необходимы автоматизированные тесты для бэкенда Quarkus и фронтенда Angular с поддержкой Maven и Playwright.","ar":"مثالي لعميل البرمجيات الكامل الذي يحتاج إلى اختبارات آلية لبرامج الخلفية Quarkus وبرامج الواجهة الأمامية Angular مع دعم Maven و Playwright."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate unit, integration, and e2e testing using Maven and Playwright, streamlining the development process with efficient test execution and validation of Quarkus and Angular codebases.","zh":"赋予代理自动化单元、集成和端到端测试的能力，使用Maven和Playwright简化开发过程，高效地执行测试并验证Quarkus和Angular代码库。","ja":"エージェントにMavenとPlaywrightを使用してユニット、統合、エンドツーエンドテストの自動化を可能にし、開発プロセスを合理化し、QuarkusとAngularのコードベースのテストを効率的に実行および検証します。","ko":"에이전트가 Maven과 Playwright를 사용하여 단위, 통합, 종단 간 테스트의 자동화를 가능하게 하여 개발 프로세스를 간소화하고 Quarkus 및 Angular 코드베이스의 테스트를 효율적으로 실행 및 검증합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar pruebas unitarias, de integración y de extremo a extremo utilizando Maven y Playwright, simplificando el proceso de desarrollo con una ejecución y validación de pruebas eficientes de los codebases de Quarkus y Angular.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tests unitaires, d''intégration et de bout en bout en utilisant Maven et Playwright, simplifiant le processus de développement avec une exécution et une validation de tests efficaces des bases de code Quarkus et Angular.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Einheitstests, Integrations- und End-to-End-Tests mit Maven und Playwright zu automatisieren, wodurch der Entwicklungsprozess durch effiziente Testausführung und Validierung der Quarkus- und Angular-Codebases gestreamt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar testes unitários, de integração e de ponta a ponta usando Maven e Playwright, otimizando o processo de desenvolvimento com execução de testes eficiente e validação dos repositórios de código Quarkus e Angular.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать модульные, интеграционные и тесты от начала до конца, используя Maven и Playwright, оптимизируя процесс разработки за счет эффективной выполнения тестов и проверки кодовых баз Quarkus и Angular.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على أتمتة الاختبارات الوحدوية والتركيبية واختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية باستخدام Maven و Playwright، ويعزز من عملية التطوير من خلال تنفيذ الاختبارات بكفاءة وتأكيد صحة مستودعات كود Quarkus و Angular."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating unit tests for Quarkus backend","Running integration tests for Angular frontend","Executing e2e tests with Playwright for comprehensive application validation"],"zh":["为Quarkus后端自动化单元测试","为Angular前端运行集成测试","使用Playwright执行端到端测试以进行全面应用程序验证"],"ja":["Quarkusバックエンドのユニットテストの自動化","Angularフロントエンドの統合テストの実行","Playwrightを使用したエンドツーエンドテストの実行による包括的なアプリケーションの検証"],"ko":["Quarkus 백엔드의 유닛 테스트 자동화","Angular 프론트엔드의 통합 테스트 실행","Playwright를 사용한 종단 간 테스트의 실행을 통한 포괄적인 애플리케이션 검증"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas unitarias para backend Quarkus","Ejecutar pruebas de integración para frontend Angular","Ejecutar pruebas de extremo a extremo con Playwright para una validación de aplicaciones completa"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests unitaires pour le backend Quarkus","Exécuter les tests d''intégration pour le frontend Angular","Exécuter les tests de bout en bout avec Playwright pour une validation complète des applications"],"de":["Automatisieren von Einheitstests für Quarkus-Backend","Ausführen von Integrations-Tests für Angular-Frontend","Ausführen von End-to-End-Tests mit Playwright für eine umfassende Anwendungsvalidierung"],"pt":["Automatizar testes unitários para backend Quarkus","Executar testes de integração para frontend Angular","Executar testes de ponta a ponta com Playwright para validação abrangente da aplicação"],"ru":["Автоматизация модульных тестов для бэкенда Quarkus","Запуск интеграционных тестов для фронтенда Angular","Выполнение тестов от начала до конца с помощью Playwright для комплексной проверки приложения"],"ar":["أتمتة الاختبارات الوحدوية لبرامج الخلفية Quarkus","تشغيل الاختبارات التركيبية لبرامج الواجهة الأمامية Angular","تشغيل اختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية مع Playwright للتحقق الشامل من التطبيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Maven installation","Limited to Quarkus backend and Angular frontend","Playwright dependency for e2e testing"],"zh":["需要Maven安装","仅限Quarkus后端和Angular前端","需要Playwright依赖项进行端到端测试"],"ja":["Mavenのインストールが必要","QuarkusバックエンドとAngularフロントエンドのみ","エンドツーエンドテストにはPlaywrightの依存関係が必要"],"ko":["Maven 설치가 필요합니다.","Quarkus 백엔드와 Angular 프론트엔드만 해당합니다.","종단 간 테스트를 위해 Playwright 종속성이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere instalación de Maven","Limitado a backend Quarkus y frontend Angular","Dependencia de Playwright para pruebas de extremo a extremo"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation de Maven","Limité au backend Quarkus et au frontend Angular","Dépendance de Playwright pour les tests de bout en bout"],"de":["Benötigt Maven-Installation","Begrenzt auf Quarkus-Backend und Angular-Frontend","Playwright-Abhängigkeit für End-to-End-Tests"],"pt":["Exige instalação do Maven","Limitado a backend Quarkus e frontend Angular","Dependência do Playwright para testes de ponta a ponta"],"ru":["Требуется установка Maven","Ограничен для бэкенда Quarkus и фронтенда Angular","Зависимость от Playwright для тестов от начала до конца"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Maven","محدود لبرامج الخلفية Quarkus وبرامج الواجهة الأمامية Angular","اعتماد على Playwright لاختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"caa388b7aa4d7608c429cec8690409913b3361c17d74f92de383988850fe2ccf","qualityScore":35}');
