capemon-developer","herramientas de seguridad","tecnologías de análisis de malware","soluciones de seguridad informática"],"fr":["analyse de malware","surveillance d''applications","hooking d''API","instrumentation de logiciel","sandbox CAPEv2","développement de capemon-developer","outils de sécurité","technologies d''analyse de malware","solutions de sécurité informatique"],"de":["Malware-Analyse","Anwendungsüberwachung","API-Hooking","Software-Instrumentierung","CAPEv2-Sandbox","Entwicklung von capemon-developer","Sicherheitstools","Malware-Analysetechnologien","Lösungen für IT-Sicherheit"],"pt":["Capemon-Developer","monitoramento de malware","análise de payload","CAPEv2 sandbox","API Hooking","Process & Thread Management","desenvolvedores de segurança","ferramentas de segurança"],"ru":["Capemon-Developer","мониторинг вредоносного ПО","анализ полезной нагрузки","CAPEv2 sandbox","API Hooking","Управление процессами и потоками","разработчики безопасности","инструменты безопасности"],"ar":["Capemon-Developer","مراقبة البرمجيات الخبيثة","تحليل الحمولة","CAPEv2 sandbox","API Hooking","إدارة العمليات والخيط","مطورو الأمان","أدوات الأمان"]}},"owner":"kevoreilly","repo":"capemon","repoPath":"kevoreilly/capemon","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.562Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"capemon-developer","description":"Expert capability for navigating, modifying, and extending the capemon malware monitoring codebase. Includes deep knowledge of Windows API hooking, PE structures, and the CAPEv2 sandbox architecture.","bodyPreview":"# Capemon Skills\n\n`capemon` is a sophisticated monitoring and instrumentation engine designed for malware analysis, configuration extraction, and payload recovery. It acts as the core injection component for the CAPEv2 sandbox.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. API Hooking & Monitoring\n`capemon` implements an extensive hooking engine derived from `cuckoomon-modified`, providing deep visibility into application behavior across multiple subsystems:\n- **Process & Thread Management:** Monitoring creatio","body":"# Capemon Skills\n\n`capemon` is a sophisticated monitoring and instrumentation engine designed for malware analysis, configuration extraction, and payload recovery. It acts as the core injection component for the CAPEv2 sandbox.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. API Hooking & Monitoring\n`capemon` implements an extensive hooking engine derived from `cuckoomon-modified`, providing deep visibility into application behavior across multiple subsystems:\n- **Process & Thread Management:** Monitoring creation, termination, and manipulation of processes and threads.\n- **File System Operations:** Tracking file creation, deletion, reading, and writing.\n- **Registry Activity:** Capturing configuration changes and persistence mechanisms.\n- **Network Communication:** Intercepting socket operations, DNS queries, and high-level protocol activity (HTTP, etc.).\n- **Cryptography:** Extracting keys and monitoring encryption/decryption routines.\n- **Synchronization & Services:** Monitoring mutexes, events, and Windows Service interactions.\n- **Windows Management Instrumentation (WMI):** Intercepting WMI queries used for anti-analysis or reconnaissance.\n- **Scripting Engines:** Specific hooks for VBScript and other language runtimes.\n\n### 2. Debugging & Tracing\n`capemon` implements a powerful in-process debugger independent of Windows debugging interfaces, but harnessing the capabilities of the processor:\n- **Hardware breakpoints:** Four breakpoints bp0-bp3 that can be set on execute, read or write\n- **Software breakpoints:** Unlimited INT3 or ''CC'' breakpoints overwriting instruction byte\n- **Single-step:** Tracing allows instruction-level capture enhanced with configurable step-over, trace-length, register changes, function names, strings & more\n- **Actions:** Configurable actions allow control flow manipulation with skipped or taken jumps, arbitrary register changes or jumps, string capture, dumps, scans & more\n- **Programmable:** Debugger configurable either on submission with simple text options or via dynamic YARA signature scans during unpacking or detonation\n- **Integration:** Hooking engine integrated with optional behavior log output & breakpoints set on return from hooked APIs (break-on-return)\n- **Stealth:** Debugger does not rely upon Windows interface and thus evades detection by a slew of interface-related indicators, with additional stealth from hook-based protections\n\n### 3. Automated Unpacking\n''capemon'' implements a powerful unpacking engine using a combination of techniques\n- **Memory region tracking:** Regions of memory revealed through indicators of execution, allocation or protection are tracked\n- **Early capture:** Multiple possible triggers allow payload capture at earliest moment often resulting in working unpacked samples\n- **Injection capture:**: Strong coverage of injection techniques for inter-process payload capture\n- **PE unmapping:** Integrated Scylla engine allows capture of memory or file-mapped PE images in memory\n- **Shellcode dumping:** Shellcode * non-PE regions equally captured as payloads\n- **Import Reconstruction:** Repairing Import Address Tables (IAT) to create functional dumped executables.\n- **AMSI Dumping:** Intercepting and dumping buffers passed to the Antimalware Scan Interface (AMSI).\n\n### 4. Config Extraction\nAutomated Static & Dynamic malware configuration extraction relies on ''capemon'' capabilities\n- **Static extraction:** Typically reliant upon capemon''s unpacking or process dump capture before static parsing\n- **Dynamic extraction:** When parser implementation is onerous, dynamic capture of decrypted configs can be performed by debugger via YARA signature\n\n### 5. YARA integration\nIntegration of YARA for in-memory scanning\n- **Dynamic configuration:** Sandbox configuration such as hooking exclusions or options implemented during detonation\n- **Debugger programming:** Precise dydnamic breakpoint address resolution using YARA signatures & cape-specific metadata\n- **Unpacking engine integration:** Dynamic scanning of all memory regions prior to unpacking capture\n- **Function resolution:** Allows dynamic address resolution for APIs or functions for hooking or other purposes\n\n## Technical Foundations\n- **Platform:** Windows (x86 and x64).\n- **Hooking Method:** Inline hooking of Win32 and Native APIs (NTAPI).\n- **Debugger:** Native in-process ''self'' debugging utilising minimal OS interfaces & hardware capabilities (breakpoint, single-step)\n- **Dependencies:** \n    - `distorm` for instruction decoding.\n    - `libyara` for pattern matching.\n    - `Scylla` for PE reconstruction.\n    - `bson` for data serialization.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:38.587Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Malware Analysis Agents needing advanced API hooking and monitoring capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级API hooking和监控能力的恶意软件分析代理。","ja":"高度なAPIフッキングと監視機能を必要とするマルウェア分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 API hooking 및 모니터링 기능이 필요한 악성 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para los Agentes de Análisis de Malware que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de enganche y monitoreo de API.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Malware ayant besoin de capacités de hooking et de surveillance d''API avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Malware-Analyse-Agenten, die erweiterte API-Hooking- und Überwachungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Malware que precisam de recursos avançados de hooking e monitoramento de API.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа вредоносного ПО, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности перехвата и мониторинга API.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تحليل البرمجيات الخبيثة الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحويل呼و API ورصدها."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to monitor application behavior across multiple subsystems, including process and thread management, using an extensive hooking engine derived from cuckoomon-modified, providing deep visibility into configuration extraction and payload recovery through API hooking and monitoring.","zh":"赋予代理监控应用程序行为的能力，跨多个子系统，包括进程和线程管理，使用来自cuckoomon-modified的广泛的hooking引擎，提供对配置提取和有效载荷恢复通过API hooking和监控的深入可见性。","ja":"エージェントに、アプリケーションの動作を監視する能力を付与します。複数のサブシステム、プロセスおよびスレッド管理を横断して、cuckoomon-modifiedから派生した広範なフッキングエンジンを使用して、APIフッキングおよび監視による設定抽出およびペイロード復旧の深い可視性を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 애플리케이션 동작을 모니터링 할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 프로세스 및 스레드 관리를 포함한 여러 하위 시스템에서 작동하는 cuckoomon-modified에서 파생된 광범위한 hooking 엔진을 사용하여 API hooking 및 모니터링을 통해 구성 추출 및 페이로드 복구에 대한 깊은 가시성을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a monitorear el comportamiento de las aplicaciones en varios subsistemas, incluyendo la gestión de procesos y subprocesos, utilizando un motor de enganche extenso derivado de cuckoomon-modificado, proporcionando una visibilidad profunda en la extracción de configuración y la recuperación de payloads a través del enganche y monitoreo de API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de surveiller le comportement des applications à travers plusieurs sous-systèmes, notamment la gestion des processus et des threads, en utilisant un moteur de hooking étendu dérivé de cuckoomon-modifié, fournissant une visibilité approfondie dans l''extraction de configuration et la récupération de charges utiles via le hooking et la surveillance d''API.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, das Verhalten von Anwendungen über mehrere Subsysteme hinweg zu überwachen, einschließlich Prozess- und Thread-Verwaltung, unter Verwendung eines umfassenden Hooking-Engines, der von cuckoomon-modified abgeleitet ist, und bietet eine tiefe Einblick in die Konfigurationsextraktion und Payload-Wiederherstellung durch API-Hooking und -Überwachung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a monitorar o comportamento da aplicação em vários subsistemas, incluindo gerenciamento de processos e threads, usando um motor de hooking extensivo derivado do cuckoomon-modificado, fornecendo visibilidade profunda na extração de configuração e recuperação de carga útil por meio de hooking e monitoramento de API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью мониторить поведение приложения в нескольких подсистемах, включая управление процессами и потоками, используя обширный движок перехвата, полученный из модифицированного cuckoomon, обеспечивая глубокую видимость извлечения конфигурации и восстановления полезной нагрузки через перехват и мониторинг API.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على مراقبة سلوك التطبيق عبر عدة أنظمة فرعية، بما في ذلك إدارة العمليات والخيط، باستخدام محرك حوك متقدم مشتق من cuckoomon-modified، يقدم رؤية عميقة في استخراج التكوين واستعادة الحمولة من خلال حوك ومراقبة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Monitoring malware behavior for security research","Extracting configurations from suspicious applications","Recovering payloads from malware samples"],"zh":["用于安全研究的恶意软件行为监控","从可疑应用程序中提取配置","从恶意软件样本中恢复有效载荷"],"ja":["セキュリティ研究のためのマルウェア動作の監視","疑わしいアプリケーションからの設定抽出","マルウェアサンプルからのペイロード復元"],"ko":["보안 연구를 위한 악성 코드 동작 모니터링","의심스러운 애플리케이션에서 구성 추출","악성 코드 샘플에서 페이로드 복구"],"es":["Monitorear el comportamiento de malware para investigación de seguridad","Extraer configuraciones de aplicaciones sospechosas","Recuperar payloads de muestras de malware"],"fr":["Surveiller le comportement de malware pour la recherche de sécurité","Extraire des configurations d''applications suspectes","Récupérer des charges utiles d''échantillons de malware"],"de":["Überwachung des Malware-Verhaltens für Sicherheitsforschung","Extraktion von Konfigurationen aus verdächtigen Anwendungen","Wiederherstellung von Payloads aus Malware-Proben"],"pt":["Monitorar o comportamento de malware para pesquisas de segurança","Extrair configurações de aplicações suspeitas","Recuperar cargas úteis de amostras de malware"],"ru":["Мониторинг поведения вредоносного ПО для исследований безопасности","Извлечение конфигураций из подозрительных приложений","Восстановление полезных нагрузок из образцов вредоносного ПО"],"ar":["مراقبة سلوك البرمجيات الخبيثة لأبحاث الأمن","استخراج التكوين من التطبيقات المشبوهة","استعادة الحمولات من عينات البرمجيات الخبيثة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires CAPEv2 sandbox integration","Limited to Windows-based applications"],"zh":["需要CAPEv2沙盒集成","仅限于Windows基于的应用程序"],"ja":["CAPEv2サンドボックス統合が必要","Windowsベースのアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["CAPEv2 샌드박스 통합이 필요","Windows 기반 애플리케이션으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere integración con sandbox de CAPEv2","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en Windows"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec le sandbox CAPEv2","Limité aux applications basées sur Windows"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit CAPEv2-Sandbox","Begrenzt auf Windows-basierte Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer integração com sandbox CAPEv2","Limitado a aplicações baseadas no Windows"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с песочницей CAPEv2","Ограничен для приложений на основе Windows"],"ar":["يحتاج إلى دمج مع sandbox CAPEv2","محدود للتطبيقات المبنية على نظام ويندوز"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"25b0266c3933f3b48b96dcbac37f1d9860493b08986fc9d319afa75a0a190f19","qualityScore":35}');
