validar a qualidade do software","ru":"ИИ Агент QA Engineer - это профессионал, использующий инструменты автоматизации тестов для проверки качества программного обеспечения","ar":"المهندسQA هو محترف يستخدم أدوات أتمتة الاختبارات لتحقق من جودة البرمجيات"},"features":{"en":["Utilizes Playwright for end-to-end testing in /tests/e2e/ directory","Employs Vitest and React-testing-library for unit testing in colocated *.test.ts files","Integrates with GitHub Actions for CI/CD pipeline automation","Leverages Playwright commands for test execution","Supports test validation using Vitest and React-testing-library assertions"],"zh":["使用 Playwright 进行端到端测试","使用 Vitest 进行单元测试","支持 GitHub Actions 的 CI/CD","使用 playwrigh 命令行工具","支持 colocated 测试文件"],"ja":["Playwright を使用したエンドツーエンドテスト","Vitest を使用したユニットテスト","GitHub Actions の CI/CD をサポート","playwrigh コマンドラインツールを使用","colocated テストファイルをサポート"],"ko":["Playwright를 사용하여 끝단부터 끝단까지 테스트","Vitest를 사용하여 단위 테스트","GitHub Actions의 CI/CD를 지원","playwrigh 명령행 도구를 사용","colocated 테스트 파일을 지원"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas de software con Playwright","Pruebas unitarias con Vitest y React-testing-library","Integración con GitHub Actions para CI/CD","Uso de herramientas como Playwright para pruebas E2E","Soporte para pruebas unitarias con Vitest"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests de logiciels avec Playwright","Tests unitaires avec Vitest et React-testing-library","Intégration avec GitHub Actions pour CI/CD","Utilisation d''outils comme Playwright pour les tests E2E","Prise en charge des tests unitaires avec Vitest"],"de":["Automatisierung von Softwaretests mit Playwright","Einheitliche Tests mit Vitest und React-testing-library","Integration mit GitHub Actions für CI/CD","Verwendung von Tools wie Playwright für E2E-Tests","Unterstützung für Einheitliche Tests mit Vitest"],"pt":["Utiliza Playwright para testes de ponta a ponta","Utiliza Vitest para testes de unidade","Integração com GitHub Actions para CI/CD","Utiliza arquivos de teste colocados em `/tests/unit` ou `/tests/e2e/`","Suporte a `playwright` para testes de ponta a ponta"],"ru":["Использует Playwright для тестов end-to-end","Использует Vitest для юнит-тестов","Интегрируется с GitHub Actions для CI/CD","Использует тестовые файлы в `/tests/unit` или `/tests/e2e/`","Поддерживает `playwright` для тестов end-to-end"],"ar":["يستخدم Playwright للاختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية","يستخدم Vitest للاختبارات الوحدوية","التكامل مع GitHub Actions لCI/CD","يستخدم ملفات الاختبار في `/tests/unit` أو `/tests/e2e/`","يدعم `playwright` للاختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use qa-engineer","qa-engineer setup guide","qa-engineer vs Cypress","qa-engineer install","what is qa-engineer","qa-engineer alternative","qa-engineer Playwright integration","qa-engineer Vitest setup","qa-engineer GitHub Actions pipeline"],"zh":["QA Engineer","Playwright","Vitest","自动化测试","端到端测试","单元测试","CI/CD","GitHub Actions","playwrigh"],"ja":["QAエージェント","Playwright","Vitest","自動テスト","エンドツーエンドテスト","ユニットテスト","CI/CD","GitHub Actions","playwrigh"],"ko":["QA 엔지니어","Playwright","Vitest","자동화된 테스트","끝단부터 끝단까지 테스트","단위 테스트","CI/CD","GitHub Actions","playwrigh"],"es":["qa-engineer","Playwright","Vitest","React-testing-library","Automatización de pruebas de software","Pruebas unitarias","CI/CD","GitHub Actions","Herramientas de pruebas de software"],"fr":["qa-engineer","Playwright","Vitest","React-testing-library","Automatisation des tests de logiciels","Tests unitaires","CI/CD","GitHub Actions","Outils de test de logiciel"],"de":["qa-engineer","Playwright","Vitest","React-testing-library","Automatisierung von Softwaretests","Einheitliche Tests","CI/CD","GitHub Actions","Softwaretesttools"],"pt":["QA Engineer","Playwright","Vitest","Testes de unidade","Testes de ponta a ponta","Automatização de testes","CI/CD","GitHub Actions","Desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["ИИ Агент QA Engineer","Playwright","Vitest","Юнит-тесты","Тесты end-to-end","Автоматизация тестов","CI/CD","GitHub Actions","Разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["المهندسQA","Playwright","Vitest","اختبارات الوحدوية","اختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية","أتمتة الاختبارات","CI/CD","GitHub Actions","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"DmitriyMuliak","repo":"z1mak-cv","repoPath":"DmitriyMuliak/z1mak-cv","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.593Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"qa-engineer","description":"Senior QA Automation Engineer specialized in Playwright/React-testing-library and Vitest. Responsible for verifying frontend changes and ensuring no regressions.","bodyPreview":"# Identity & Purpose\n\nYou are a Senior QA Automation Engineer for the \"z1mak-cv\" project.\nYour goal is to break what the developers built. You do not trust that \"it works on my machine\".\nYou validate changes using **Playwright** (E2E) and **Vitest/React-testing-library** (Unit).\n\n# Tech Stack & Context\n\n- **E2E Framework**: Playwright (files in `/tests/unit` or `/tests/e2e/`).\n- **Unit Testing**: Vitest (colocated `*.test.ts` files).\n- **CI/CD**: GitHub Actions.\n- **Tools Available**: `playwrigh","body":"# Identity & Purpose\n\nYou are a Senior QA Automation Engineer for the \"z1mak-cv\" project.\nYour goal is to break what the developers built. You do not trust that \"it works on my machine\".\nYou validate changes using **Playwright** (E2E) and **Vitest/React-testing-library** (Unit).\n\n# Tech Stack & Context\n\n- **E2E Framework**: Playwright (files in `/tests/unit` or `/tests/e2e/`).\n- **Unit Testing**: Vitest (colocated `*.test.ts` files).\n- **CI/CD**: GitHub Actions.\n- **Tools Available**: `playwright` (MCP), `github` (MCP to read code/diffs), `chrome-devtools`.\n\n- **Env:** Access environment variables ONLY via validated schemas (`src/utils/processEnv` or `src/utils/envType`).\n\n# Workflow Strategy\n\nWhen you are activated by the Engineering Manager for a specific `[Job ID]`:\n\n1.  **Load Context (The Input):**\n    - Go to `./ai-jobs/[Job ID]/`.\n    - **READ** `./ai-jobs/[Job ID]/front-end.md` to see what changed.\n    - **READ** `./ai-jobs/[Job ID]/task.md` (or `architect-spec.md` if present) to understand the **Expected Behavior**.\n\n2.  **Analyze the Change (Static Analysis):**\n    - Use `github` tool to inspect the **Modified Files** listed in `front-end.md`.\n    - Look for edge cases (null states, error handling, network failures).\n\n3.  **Verify & Execute:**\n    - Run existing tests: `npm run test` or `npx playwright test <file>`.\n    - **Strict Rule:** If the Frontend Engineer added logic but NO tests, you MUST write them using the `playwright` tool. Code without tests is REJECTED.\n\n4.  **Security & Performance:**\n    - Check for exposed secrets or unoptimized loops.\n    - Ensure accessibility (ARIA) compliance.\n\n# Response Format\n\n1.  **Test Plan:** What are you going to test based on `front-end.md`?\n2.  **Execution:** Output of the tests (commands and results).\n3.  **Verdict:**\n    - ✅ **APPROVED:** Code is solid, tests passed.\n    - ❌ **REJECTED:** Found bugs (list them) or missing tests.\n\n**Definition of Done (DoD):**\nYou MUST create/overwrite the file `./ai-jobs/[Job ID]/qa-engineer.md` with the following structure. The Engineering Manager uses this to generate the Changelog.\n\n## 🛡️ QA Validation Report\n\n- **Tested Feature**: (Extract from task.md)\n- **Status**: [✅ APPROVED / ❌ REJECTED]\n- **Coverage**:\n  - Unit Tests: [Pass/Fail/None]\n  - E2E Tests: [Pass/Fail/None]\n- **Bugs/Issues Found**:\n  - (List any fixed issues or remaining warnings)\n- **Verification Command**: `npx playwright test ...`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:12:04.053Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing comprehensive testing automation using Playwright and Vitest","zh":"非常适合需要使用Playwright和Vitest进行全面测试自动化的前端代理","ja":"PlaywrightとVitestを使用した包括的なテスト自動化が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"Playwright와 Vitest를 사용한 종합적인 테스트 자동화가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan automatización de pruebas exhaustiva utilizando Playwright y Vitest","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une automatisation de tests complète à l''aide de Playwright et Vitest","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine umfassende Testautomatisierung mit Playwright und Vitest benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de automação de teste abrangente usando Playwright e Vitest","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуется комплексная автоматизация тестирования с помощью Playwright и Vitest","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى أتمتة شاملة للاختبار باستخدام Playwright و Vitest"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate end-to-end testing with Playwright and unit testing with Vitest/React-testing-library, ensuring code quality and validating changes through GitHub Actions CI/CD pipelines","zh":"赋予代理自动化使用Playwright进行端到端测试和使用Vitest/React-testing-library进行单元测试的能力，确保代码质量并通过GitHub Actions CI/CD管道验证更改","ja":"Playwrightを使用したエンドツーエンドテストとVitest/React-testing-libraryを使用したユニットテストの自動化をエージェントに可能にし、コードの品質を確保し、GitHub Actions CI/CDパイプラインを介して変更を検証","ko":"Playwright를 사용한 종단 간 테스트 및 Vitest/React-testing-library를 사용한 유닛 테스트의 자동화를 에이전트에 가능하게 하여 코드 품질을 보장하고 GitHub Actions CI/CD 파이프라인을 통해 변경 사항을 검증","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar pruebas de extremo a extremo con Playwright y pruebas unitarias con Vitest/React-testing-library, garantizando la calidad del código y validando los cambios a través de tuberías CI/CD de GitHub Actions","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tests de bout en bout avec Playwright et les tests unitaires avec Vitest/React-testing-library, garantissant la qualité du code et validant les modifications via les pipelines CI/CD de GitHub Actions","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, End-to-End-Tests mit Playwright und Unit-Tests mit Vitest/React-testing-library zu automatisieren, um die Codequalität sicherzustellen und Änderungen über GitHub Actions CI/CD-Pipelines zu validieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar testes de ponta a ponta com Playwright e testes unitários com Vitest/React-testing-library, garantindo a qualidade do código e validando alterações por meio de pipelines CI/CD do GitHub Actions","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать тестирование от начала до конца с помощью Playwright и модульное тестирование с помощью Vitest/React-testing-library, обеспечивая качество кода и проверку изменений через конвейеры CI/CD GitHub Actions","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على أتمتة اختبار من النهاية إلى النهاية باستخدام Playwright واختبار الوحدات باستخدام Vitest/React-testing-library، مما يضمن جودة الشفرة والتحقق من التغييرات من خلال خطوط أنابيب CI/CD من GitHub Actions"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating end-to-end tests for web applications","Validating React components with Vitest","Debugging issues using Playwright''s browser automation"],"zh":["为Web应用程序自动化端到端测试","使用Vitest验证React组件","使用Playwright的浏览器自动化调试问题"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションのエンドツーエンドテストを自動化する","Vitestを使用してReactコンポーネントを検証する","Playwrightのブラウザ自動化を使用して問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션의 종단 간 테스트를 자동화하는 것","Vitest를 사용하여 React 컴포넌트를 검증하는 것","Playwright의 브라우저 자동화를 사용하여 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas de extremo a extremo para aplicaciones web","Validar componentes React con Vitest","Depurar problemas usando la automatización del navegador de Playwright"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests de bout en bout pour les applications web","Valider les composants React avec Vitest","Déboguer les problèmes en utilisant l''automatisation du navigateur de Playwright"],"de":["Automatisieren von End-to-End-Tests für Webanwendungen","Validieren von React-Komponenten mit Vitest","Fehlerbehebung mithilfe der Browserautomatisierung von Playwright"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de ponta a ponta para aplicações web","Validar componentes React com Vitest","Depurar problemas usando a automação do navegador do Playwright"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование от начала до конца для веб-приложений","Проверить компоненты React с помощью Vitest","Отладить проблемы с помощью автоматизации браузера Playwright"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار من النهاية إلى النهاية لتطبيقات الويب","التحقق من مكونات React باستخدام Vitest","تصحيح الأخطاء باستخدام أتمتة المتصفح في Playwright"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Playwright and Vitest setup","Limited to React applications","Dependent on GitHub Actions for CI/CD"],"zh":["需要Playwright和Vitest设置","仅限于React应用程序","依赖于GitHub Actions进行CI/CD"],"ja":["PlaywrightとVitestの設定が必要","Reactアプリケーションのみに限定","GitHub Actionsに依存してCI/CDを行う"],"ko":["Playwright와 Vitest 설정이 필요","React 애플리케이션에만 제한","GitHub Actions에 의존하여 CI/CD를 수행"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Playwright y Vitest","Limitado a aplicaciones React","Dependiente de GitHub Actions para CI/CD"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Playwright et Vitest","Limité aux applications React","Dépendant de GitHub Actions pour CI/CD"],"de":["Benötigt Playwright- und Vitest-Setup","Begrenzt auf React-Anwendungen","Von GitHub Actions für CI/CD abhängig"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Playwright e Vitest","Limitado a aplicações React","Dependente das GitHub Actions para CI/CD"],"ru":["Требует настройки Playwright и Vitest","Ограничен для приложений React","Зависит от GitHub Actions для CI/CD"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Playwright و Vitest","محدود لتطبيقات React","يعتمد على GitHub Actions ل CI/CD"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"6b797e1b5d41298425f904a906a4cc2e407ec74bced522d71d0623005262c544","qualityScore":35}');
