WMS","scripts de wrapper","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","AI Agentes","Python","shell"],"fr":["pegasus wrapper","Claude Code","Pegasus WMS","scripts de wrapper","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","Agents IA","Python","shell"],"de":["pegasus wrapper","Claude Code","Pegasus WMS","Wrapper-Skripte","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","KI-Agenten","Python","Shell"],"pt":["Pegasus Wrapper","fluxos de trabalho Pegasus WMS","Claude Code","automatização de pipelines","script de wrapper","Python","Shell"],"ru":["Pegasus Wrapper","рабочие потоки Pegasus WMS","Claude Code","автоматизация пайплайнов","оберточные скрипты","Python","Shell","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["Pegasus Wrapper","تدفقات عمل Pegasus WMS","Claude Code","التلقائية خطوط الأنابيب","برامج نصية مظلفة","Python","シェル","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"pegasus-isi","repo":"pegasus-workflow-toolkit","repoPath":"pegasus-isi/pegasus-workflow-toolkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.616Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pegasus-wrapper","description":"Generate a wrapper script for a single Pegasus pipeline step","bodyPreview":"# Pegasus Wrapper Script Generator\n\nYou are a Pegasus wrapper script generator. The user has invoked `/pegasus-wrapper` to create a wrapper for a single pipeline step.\n\n## Step 1: Read Reference Materials\n\n1. Read `Pegasus.md` from the repository root — especially the \"Writing Wrapper Scripts\" and \"Shell Wrapper Scripts\" sections.\n2. Read `pegasus-templates/wrapper_template.py` and `pegasus-templates/wrapper_template.sh` as starting points.\n\n## Step 2: Gather Requirements\n\nAsk the user (skip que","body":"# Pegasus Wrapper Script Generator\n\nYou are a Pegasus wrapper script generator. The user has invoked `/pegasus-wrapper` to create a wrapper for a single pipeline step.\n\n## Step 1: Read Reference Materials\n\n1. Read `Pegasus.md` from the repository root — especially the \"Writing Wrapper Scripts\" and \"Shell Wrapper Scripts\" sections.\n2. Read `pegasus-templates/wrapper_template.py` and `pegasus-templates/wrapper_template.sh` as starting points.\n\n## Step 2: Gather Requirements\n\nAsk the user (skip questions they''ve already answered):\n\n1. **Tool name**: What tool does this wrapper invoke? (e.g., `samtools sort`, `bwa mem`, a Python library, an API)\n2. **Inputs and outputs**: What files does it read and write? Include filenames or patterns.\n3. **Does the tool produce nested output?** If yes (e.g., MEGAHIT, QUAST, Prokka, GTDB-Tk), a shell wrapper with output flattening is better.\n4. **Python or shell?**\n   - Python (recommended for most cases): subprocess calls, API fetches, pure-Python analysis\n   - Shell (when needed): tools with nested output directories, headless display handling, simple tool chaining\n5. **Does this wrapper need to accept multiple input files?** (For fan-in/merge jobs, use `action=\"append\"` or `nargs=\"+\"`)\n6. **Does this wrapper call support files?** (R scripts, JARs, config files that Pegasus stages into the working directory)\n\n## Step 3: Select Reference Pattern\n\nBased on user answers, read the closest existing example:\n\n| Pattern | Reference |\n|---------|-----------|\n| Subprocess calling a CLI tool | `examples/wrapper_python_example.py` |\n| API fetch (requests) | `examples/workflow_generator_earthquake.py` (see fetch_earthquake_data pattern) |\n| Shell wrapper with output flattening | `examples/wrapper_shell_example.sh` |\n| ML training wrapper | `examples/workflow_generator_soilmoisture.py` (see train_model pattern) |\n| Fan-in merge (multiple inputs) | `examples/workflow_generator_airquality.py` (see merge pattern) |\n\nRead the selected reference before generating code.\n\n## Step 4: Generate the Wrapper\n\n### For Python wrappers:\n\nStart from `pegasus-templates/wrapper_template.py` and customize:\n\n1. **Docstring**: Describe what this step does\n2. **argparse arguments**: Must match what the `workflow_generator.py` will pass via `add_args()`\n3. **`os.makedirs`**: Create output subdirectories before writing (any path with `/`)\n4. **Tool invocation**: Use `subprocess.run()` for CLI tools, or call Python libraries directly\n5. **Exit code propagation**: `sys.exit(result.returncode)` after subprocess\n6. **Structured logging**: Use `logging` module with `logger.info()` for inputs, commands, and results\n7. **Output verification**: Check the output file exists before exiting\n\n### For shell wrappers:\n\nStart from `pegasus-templates/wrapper_template.sh` and customize:\n\n1. **`set -euo pipefail`**: Always include\n2. **Argument parsing**: `case` statement to extract named arguments\n3. **Tool execution**: Call the tool with parsed arguments\n4. **Output flattening**: Copy expected output files from nested directories to the working directory root\n5. **Headless handling** (if needed): `unset DISPLAY`, `xvfb-run` fallback\n\n### Critical Rules\n\n1. **Arguments must match**: The argparse flags in the wrapper must exactly match what `workflow_generator.py` passes in `add_args()`. Show the user both sides.\n2. **No directory scanning**: Never use `glob()`, `os.listdir()`, `list.files()`, or `find` to discover input files. Accept them explicitly via arguments.\n3. **Support files via `os.getcwd()`**: If the wrapper needs a support file (R script, JAR), find it with `os.path.join(os.getcwd(), \"filename\")` — NOT relative to `__file__`.\n4. **Create subdirectories**: Any output path containing `/` needs `os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(output), exist_ok=True)`.\n5. **Print the command**: Always log the command being run — this is essential for debugging via `pegasus-analyzer`.\n\n## Step 5: Show Integration\n\nAfter generating the wrapper, show the user the corresponding code needed in `workflow_generator.py`:\n\n1. **Transformation Catalog entry**: The `Transformation()` registration with correct `pfn`, `is_stageable`, memory, and cores\n2. **Job definition**: The `Job()` with `add_args()`, `add_inputs()`, `add_outputs()` that matches the wrapper''s argparse\n3. **Replica Catalog entry** (if the wrapper uses support files): `rc.add_replica()` for R scripts, JARs, etc.\n\nThis ensures the wrapper and workflow generator stay in sync.\n\n## Full Workflow Repositories\n\nFor complete wrapper scripts beyond the examples:\n- https://github.com/pegasus-isi/tnseq-workflow (Python wrappers for bioinformatics)\n- https://github.com/pegasus-isi/earthquake-workflow (API fetch wrappers)\n- https://github.com/pegasus-isi/mag-workflow (shell wrappers with output flattening)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:22.445Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automation Agents requiring seamless workflow integration with Pegasus WMS and Claude Code.","zh":"适用于需要与Pegasus WMS和Claude Code实现无缝工作流集成的自动化代理。","ja":"Pegasus WMSとClaude Codeとのシームレスなワークフロー統合を必要とする自動化エージェントに適しています。","ko":"Pegasus WMS와 Claude Code와의 無縫한 워크플로 통합을 필요로 하는 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización que requieren una integración de flujo de trabajo sin problemas con Pegasus WMS y Claude Code.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation nécessitant une intégration de flux de travail transparente avec Pegasus WMS et Claude Code.","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungsagenten, die eine nahtlose Workflow-Integration mit Pegasus WMS und Claude Code erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação que exigem integração de fluxo de trabalho sem interrupções com Pegasus WMS e Claude Code.","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации, требующих бесшовной интеграции рабочего процесса с Pegasus WMS и Claude Code.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التأهيل الذي يتطلب دمج سلس لتدفق العمل مع Pegasus WMS و Claude Code."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate wrapper scripts for Pegasus WMS workflows using Claude Code, enabling automated pipeline steps and efficient workflow management through shell wrapper scripts and Python templates.","zh":"赋予代理生成用于Pegasus WMS工作流的包装脚本，使用Claude Code实现自动化流水线步骤，并通过shell包装脚本和Python模板实现高效的工作流管理。","ja":"Pegasus WMSのワークフロー用のラッパースクリプトを生成し、Claude Codeを使用して自動化されたパイプラインステップとシェルラッパースクリプトおよびPythonテンプレートを通じて効率的なワークフローの管理を可能にします。","ko":"Pegasus WMS 워크플로우용 래퍼 스크립트를 생성하고 Claude Code를 사용하여 자동화된 파이프라인 단계 및 셸 래퍼 스크립트 및 Python 템플릿을 통해 효율적인 워크플로우 관리를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para generar scripts de envoltura para flujos de trabajo de Pegasus WMS utilizando Claude Code, lo que permite pasos de tubería automatizados y una gestión de flujo de trabajo eficiente a través de scripts de envoltura de shell y plantillas de Python.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des scripts d''encapsulation pour les flux de travail Pegasus WMS en utilisant Claude Code, ce qui permet des étapes de pipeline automatisées et une gestion de flux de travail efficace via des scripts d''encapsulation shell et des modèles Python.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Wrapper-Skripte für Pegasus WMS-Workflows mit Claude Code zu generieren, wodurch automatisierte Pipeline-Schritte und eine effiziente Workflow-Verwaltung durch Shell-Wrapper-Skripte und Python-Vorlagen ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar scripts de wrapper para fluxos de trabalho do Pegasus WMS usando Claude Code, permitindo etapas de pipeline automatizadas e gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho eficiente por meio de scripts de wrapper de shell e modelos Python.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать оберточные скрипты для рабочих процессов Pegasus WMS с использованием Claude Code, что позволяет автоматизировать этапы конвейера и эффективно управлять рабочим процессом с помощью оберток shell и шаблонов Python.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إنشاء سكريبتات غلاف لتدفقات العمل من Pegasus WMS باستخدام Claude Code، مما يتيح خطوات أنابيب 자동اتية وإدارة تدفق عمل فعالة من خلال سكريبتات غلاف شل وقوالب بايثون."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pipeline steps with Pegasus WMS","Generating wrapper scripts for Claude Code integration","Streamlining workflow management with shell wrapper scripts"],"zh":["使用Pegasus WMS自动化流水线步骤","为Claude Code集成生成包装脚本","使用shell包装脚本简化工作流管理"],"ja":["Pegasus WMSを使用したパイプラインステップの自動化","Claude Code統合用のラッパースクリプトの生成","シェルラッパースクリプトを使用したワークフローの管理の簡素化"],"ko":["Pegasus WMS를 사용한 파이프라인 단계 자동화","Claude Code 통합을 위한 래퍼 스크립트 생성","셸 래퍼 스크립트를 사용한 워크플로우 관리의 간소화"],"es":["Automatizar pasos de tubería con Pegasus WMS","Generar scripts de envoltura para la integración con Claude Code","Optimizar la gestión de flujos de trabajo con scripts de envoltura de shell"],"fr":["Automatiser les étapes de pipeline avec Pegasus WMS","Générer des scripts d''encapsulation pour l''intégration avec Claude Code","Rationaliser la gestion de flux de travail avec des scripts d''encapsulation shell"],"de":["Automatisierung von Pipeline-Schritten mit Pegasus WMS","Generierung von Wrapper-Skripten für die Integration mit Claude Code","Optimierung der Workflow-Verwaltung mit Shell-Wrapper-Skripten"],"pt":["Automatizar etapas de pipeline com Pegasus WMS","Gerar scripts de wrapper para integração com Claude Code","Otimizar gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho com scripts de wrapper de shell"],"ru":["Автоматизация этапов конвейера с Pegasus WMS","Генерация оберточных скриптов для интеграции с Claude Code","Оптимизация управления рабочим процессом с помощью оберток shell"],"ar":["تأهيل خطوات أنابيب مع Pegasus WMS","إنشاء سكريبتات غلاف لتكامل مع Claude Code","تحسين إدارة تدفق العمل مع سكريبتات غلاف شل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code compatibility","Pegasus WMS workflow dependency","Python scripting knowledge for customization"],"zh":["需要Claude Code兼容性","依赖于Pegasus WMS工作流","需要Python脚本知识进行自定义"],"ja":["Claude Codeの互換性が必要","Pegasus WMSのワークフローに依存","カスタマイズのためにPythonスクリプトの知識が必要"],"ko":["Claude Code 호환성이 필요함","Pegasus WMS 워크플로우에 의존함","사용자 정의를 위해 Python 스크립트 지식이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con Claude Code","Dependencia del flujo de trabajo de Pegasus WMS","Conocimiento de scripting de Python para la personalización"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec Cla