INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('Piece-Puzzly/Piece-iOS/merge', 'merge', 'Piece-Puzzly', 'Piece-iOS', 'community', 'merge Piece-Puzzly Piece-iOS community The merge skill automates squash merging of feature branches into main, supporting Git worktree environments and detecting develop or main branches as merge targets. 合并技能用于将当前特性分支合并到主分支，支持工作树环境 マージスキルは現在の機能ブランチをメインブランチにマージし、ワークツリー環境をサポートします 머지 스킬은 현재 피처 브랜치를 메인 브랜치에 머지하고 워크트리 환경을 지원합니다 La función merge combina la rama actual con la rama principal en Git, incluso en entornos de worktree La fonctionnalité merge combine la branche actuelle avec la branche principale Git, même dans les environnements de worktree Die Merge-Funktion kombiniert den aktuellen Zweig mit dem Hauptzweig in Git, auch in Worktree-Umgebungen O merge é uma habilidade que executa squash merge do branch de recurso atual para o branch principal, funcionando em ambientes de trabalho Слияние - это навык, который выполняет squash merge текущей функциональной ветки в основную ветку, работает в рабочих средах для ИИ Агентов الدمج هو مهارة تقوم بدمج Squash للفرع الحالي إلى الفرع الرئيسي، يعمل في بيئات العمل how to use merge in Git merge vs rebase merge setup guide for AI agents Git worktree merge squash merge best practices merge install for developers what is merge in Git merge alternative for Git workflows 合并技能 squash merge 工作树环境 Git 命令行接口 代码合并 开发效率 AI 工具 代码管理 Performs squash merge of feature branches into main using Git Detects Git worktree environments and adjusts merge behavior Automatically identifies develop or main branches as merge targets Utilizes bash scripting for environment detection and merge automation Supports merge operations in both worktree and non-worktree environments Merge is a Git-based skill that performs squash merges of feature branches into main, utilizing worktree detection and automation.');
